rabola and solve for $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(x-2)^{2} & =4(0+1) \\\\ (x-2)^{2} & =4 \\\\ x-2 & =\\pm \\sqrt{4} \\\\ x & =\\pm 2+2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the $x$-intercepts are $0$ and $4.$" 13194139533934 true] [17592186267016 1000 #edb/ref 17592186267017 13194139533934 true] [17592186267016 1000 #edb/ref 17592186267018 13194139533934 true] [17592186267016 1000 #edb/ref 17592186267019 13194139533934 true] [17592186267016 1000 #edb/ref 17592186267020 13194139533934 true] [17592186267016 1000 #edb/ref 17592186267021 13194139533934 true] [17592186267016 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533934 true] [17592186267016 1041 "selection" 13194139533934 true] [17592186267016 1104 #edb/ref 17592186267020 13194139533934 true] [17592186267016 1110 #uuid "7aae2332-ed70-5fef-961b-4db1af133793" 13194139533934 true] [17592186267017 1034 "$0$  and $\\sqrt{5}$" 13194139533934 true] [17592186267017 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533934 true] [17592186267017 1111 #uuid "ffb61613-6a7a-569d-ae98-a4dc317ebffc" 13194139533934 true] [17592186267018 1034 "$0$ and $5$" 13194139533934 true] [17592186267018 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533934 true] [17592186267018 1111 #uuid "10927cd1-a48a-5c2c-baac-cf2d39d3711b" 13194139533934 true] [17592186267019 1034 "$0$ and $3$" 13194139533934 true] [17592186267019 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533934 true] [17592186267019 1111 #uuid "cadabb28-2da1-5b93-8bc9-22ee579109d5" 13194139533934 true] [17592186267020 1034 "$0$ and $4$" 13194139533934 true] [17592186267020 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533934 true] [17592186267020 1111 #uuid "67e04df4-c99e-5b38-b2a3-89274f048a3f" 13194139533934 true] [17592186267021 1034 "$0$ and $2\\sqrt{5}$" 13194139533934 true] [17592186267021 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533934 true] [17592186267021 1111 #uuid "73029ed4-5320-5eec-a240-5c35a9fd06e1" 13194139533934 true] [17592186267022 1017 #edb/ref 17592186267023 13194139533934 true] [17592186267022 1089 "q-73847" 131941395339